(module SOT-23-6 (layer F.Cu) (tedit 6A1C0000)
  (descr "SOT-23-6 (Diodes SOT26 Type A1), pads per Diodes Inc. suggested pad layout (C 0.95, G 1.60, X 0.70, Y 0.90, Y1 3.40 mm)")
